{
  "_doc": [
    "Preinstalled apps DayZero removes. 'light' is used by Office mode, 'full' by Gaming and Everything.",
    "name:   the app package name (wildcards allowed for publisher-prefixed promo apps).",
    "Removal = the app is removed for your account and for new accounts (deprovisioned).",
    "Undo: 'DayZero.cmd -Undo' reinstalls each removed app from the Microsoft Store by its exact name;",
    "you can also search the Store for the title yourself.",
    "keep:   never removed, whatever the lists say (the code has its own copy of the essentials,",
    "        including the Store, Calculator, Photos, App Installer/winget and Windows Security).",
